[00:13.560]I just need someone in my life to give it structure
[00:13.560]我需要一个和我一起规划人生的人
[00:19.690]To handle all the selfish ways I'd spend my time without her
[00:19.690]学会控制我自私的样子
[00:26.070]You're everything I want, but I can't deal with all your lovers
[00:26.070]你是我想要的一切，但我不知如何对待你的情人
[00:32.340]Saying I'm the one, but it's your actions that speak louder
[00:32.340]说我是你的一切，但你说的和做的不一样
[00:38.670]Giving me love when you are down and need another
[00:38.670]你只有在沮丧和需要其他人的爱时才会关心我
[00:44.950]I've got to get away and let you go, I've got to get over
[00:44.950]我该成长且放手了，是时候离开你了
[00:51.240]But I love you so
[00:51.240]但我是爱你的
[00:57.600]I love you so
[00:57.600]我很爱你
[01:03.970]I love you so
[01:03.970]我很爱你
[01:10.310]I love you so
[01:10.310]我如此爱你
[01:14.950]I'm gonna pack my things and leave you behind
[01:14.950]我会整理行装和你告别
[01:20.960]This feeling's old and I know that I've made up my mind
[01:20.960]经历过很多次告别但我这次下定决心离开你
[01:27.270]I hope you feel what I felt when you shattered my soul
[01:27.270]希望你也能经历你给我的心碎
[01:33.530]'Cause you were cruel and I'm a fool
[01:33.530]因为以前我一直默许你这样残忍
[01:36.950]So please let me go
[01:36.950]那么就让我离开吧
